        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 652, Oblong Door Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Omnia made 4-3/8 inch long by 1-9/16 inch wide very sleek design cup pull allows you to slide a pocket door in and out without the pull catching. For use on sliding doors, pocket doors, cabinet doors--any door where a flush pull is desired. Flush pulls are mortised into the face of the door and this one is available in an array of finishes all made of solid brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 652 Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/652-template.pdf?v=1704262227\"><b>Omnia 652 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
